  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate occult; <strong>BL</strong> 10th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> eyes; <strong>Price</strong> 22,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1 pound<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nThese goggles are decorated with seal motifs across the lenses that curiously do not impede vision. The wearer can utter a command word in order to gain the benefits of occult sight† while wearing a pair of goggles of spirit sight. The same command word is used to end the effect.<br>\n<strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, occult sight; Cost 11,000 gp.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pm-wondrous-items#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
